{
  "typography": {
    "display": {
      "_comment": "fontSize pinned to match web's own display size (user request, 2026-10-11) — previously 28 on Android (no web override needed before this) vs web's platform-overridden 24 (see platform-overrides/web.json's own _comment on the TV-legibility bump this reverses, for display specifically). Android keeps its own font FILE (InterDisplay, see Type.kt) even though the size now matches web's plain Inter — a separate, pre-existing platform divergence this change doesn't touch.",
